  "id": "parallel-performance-scalability",
  "title": "Parallel Performance & Scalability",
  "markdown": "\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-work:visible -->\n\n### Work Decomposition\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-serial:visible:parent=sec-pp-work -->\n\n#### Serial vs Parallel\n\nProgram → 多项 Work；存在前后 Dependency 的操作 → 按依赖顺序执行（Serial）；Independent Work → Parallelizable（可并行）≠ Parallel Execution（实际并行）；真正使用多个 Core 并行，还要看硬件资源和 Overhead 是否值得\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-fraction:visible:parent=sec-pp-work -->\n\n#### Parallel Fraction & Serial Bottleneck\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-overhead:visible:parent=sec-pp-work -->\n\n#### Execution Overhead\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-models:visible -->\n\n### Speedup Models\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-speedup:visible:parent=sec-pp-models -->\n\n#### Speedup & Baseline\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-amdahl:visible:parent=sec-pp-models -->\n\n#### Amdahl's Law\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-formula:visible:parent=sec-pp-amdahl -->\n\n##### Formula, Variables & Assumptions\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-upper:visible:parent=sec-pp-amdahl -->\n\n##### Upper Bound & Diminishing Returns\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-inverse:visible:parent=sec-pp-amdahl -->\n\n##### Inverse Amdahl Problems\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-generalized:visible:parent=sec-pp-models -->\n\n#### Generalized Speedup\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-scaling:visible -->\n\n### Scaling Behavior\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-strong:visible:parent=sec-pp-scaling -->\n\n#### Strong Scaling\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-weak:visible:parent=sec-pp-scaling -->\n\n#### Weak Scaling\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-pp-limits:visible:parent=sec-pp-scaling -->\n\n#### Scaling Limits & Interpretation\n\n",
